| `input_adb_lookup(crowdstrike.csv)`
| `input_adb_lookup(nessus.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="crowdstrike.csv", "crowdstrike", source_lookup="nessus.csv", "nessus")
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach mac, nt_host, ip [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Convert case insensitive fields to lowercase ###```
| foreach mac, nt_host [eval <<FIELD>>=lower(<<FIELD>>)]
```### Build match keys (lowercased where the field is case insensitive) ###```
| eval adbk_mac = mac, adbk_nt_host = nt_host
```### Remove blocklisted values from the match keys ###```
| eval adbk_mac = mvfilter(NOT (in(lower(adbk_mac), "00:00:00:00:00:00", "ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff", "0.0.0.0", "::", "::1", "localhost", "localhost.localdomain", "unknown", "none", "null", "n/a", "na", "undefined", "-") OR match(lower(adbk_mac), "^(00[:-]?){5}00$") OR match(lower(adbk_mac), "^(ff[:-]?){5}ff$") OR cidrmatch("127.0.0.0/8", adbk_mac) OR cidrmatch("169.254.0.0/16", adbk_mac))), adbk_nt_host = mvfilter(NOT (in(lower(adbk_nt_host), "00:00:00:00:00:00", "ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff", "0.0.0.0", "::", "::1", "localhost", "localhost.localdomain", "unknown", "none", "null", "n/a", "na", "undefined", "-") OR match(lower(adbk_nt_host), "^(00[:-]?){5}00$") OR match(lower(adbk_nt_host), "^(ff[:-]?){5}ff$") OR cidrmatch("127.0.0.0/8", adbk_nt_host) OR cidrmatch("169.254.0.0/16", adbk_nt_host)))
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = mvjoin(mvdedup(mvappend(adbk_mac, adbk_nt_host)), "::")
| search _key=*
```### Sort newest first (multivalue fields keep their most recent values) ###```
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, values(adbk_mac) as adbk_mac, values(adbk_nt_host) as adbk_nt_host, list(mac) as mac, list(nt_host) as nt_host, list(ip) as ip by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = mvappend(adbk_mac, adbk_nt_host)
| adbmerge max_keys=25 max_key_share=50
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, max(adb_total) as adb_total, max(adb_null_keys) as adb_null_keys, max(adb_large_keys) as adb_large_keys, max(adb_enrich_unmatched) as adb_enrich_unmatched, max(adb_enrich_ambiguous) as adb_enrich_ambiguous, max(adb_junk_keys) as adb_junk_keys, max(adb_junk_rows) as adb_junk_rows, list(mac) as mac, list(nt_host) as nt_host, list(ip) as ip by _key
```### De-duplicate multivalue fields (order is kept) ###```
| eval mac = mvdedup(mac), nt_host = mvdedup(nt_host), ip = mvdedup(ip)
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval mac = mvindex(mac,0,4), nt_host = mvindex(nt_host,0,4), ip = mvindex(ip,0,4)
```### Run safety: how many assets did the last successful run produce? ###```
| eventstats count as adb_assets_out
| append [| makeresults | eval adb_is_marker=1 | table adb_is_marker]
| append [| inputlookup assetdb_runs | where status="ok" | sort 0 -run_time | head 1 | eval adb_is_prev=1 | rename assets_out as adb_prev_out | table adb_is_prev adb_prev_out]
| eventstats max(adb_prev_out) as adb_prev, max(adb_assets_out) as adb_assets_out
| eval adb_guard = if(isnotnull(adb_prev) AND adb_assets_out < adb_prev * 0.5, 1, 0)
```### Record this run in assetdb_runs (the last 200 runs are kept) ###```
| appendpipe [| stats max(adb_assets_out) as assets_out, max(adb_prev) as assets_prev, max(adb_guard) as guard, max(adb_total) as rows_in, max(adb_null_keys) as null_keys, max(adb_large_keys) as overflow_assets, max(adb_enrich_unmatched) as enrich_unmatched, max(adb_enrich_ambiguous) as enrich_ambiguous, max(adb_junk_keys) as junk_keys, max(adb_junk_rows) as junk_rows | eval run_time=now(), min_ratio=0.5, status=case(isnull(assets_out) OR assets_out=0, "empty", guard=1, "blocked_low_count", true(), "ok"), _key=run_time . "_" . substr(md5(tostring(random())), 1, 8) | fields - guard | inputlookup append=true assetdb_runs | sort 0 -run_time | head 200 | outputlookup assetdb_runs | where 1=0]
```### Only write the asset database when the run passed the safety check ###```
| where isnull(adb_is_marker) AND isnull(adb_is_prev) AND adb_guard=0
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, mac, nt_host, ip
| outputlookup override_if_empty=false assetdb
